    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude78 Alter Psycho</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you the spawn of the devil, or just a child?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a quiet and fog-covered village, a child shunned by society struggles to survive. Growing up without a father, labeled as the &quot;devil's son,&quot; this innocent soul takes each step surrounded by fear and paranoia. His story will take you on a deep psychological journey. In a world where no one but his mother shows him love, one night changes everything. Now, he must run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through misty forests, terrifying hallucinations, and ominous villagers, the fight isn't just for survival\u2014it's to reclaim his lost childhood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae What Awaits You in the Game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological thriller atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive and story-driven missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenes shifting between reality and delusion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth and survival mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich narrative and cinematic experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Alter Psycho&quot;</strong> offers an unforgettable narrative shaped by darkness.<br>Want to escape? First, you must find out who you really are.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude78 Alter Psycho</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you the spawn of the devil, or just a child?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a quiet and fog-covered village, a child shunned by society struggles to survive. Growing up without a father, labeled as the &quot;devil's son,&quot; this innocent soul takes each step surrounded by fear and paranoia. His story will take you on a deep psychological journey. In a world where no one but his mother shows him love, one night changes everything. Now, he must run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through misty forests, terrifying hallucinations, and ominous villagers, the fight isn't just for survival\u2014it's to reclaim his lost childhood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae What Awaits You in the Game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological thriller atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive and story-driven missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenes shifting between reality and delusion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth and survival mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich narrative and cinematic experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Alter Psycho&quot;</strong> offers an unforgettable narrative shaped by darkness.<br>Want to escape? First, you must find out who you really are.</p>",
